@CustomersApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5079

### Listar todos los clientes
GET {{CustomersApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json

### Obtener un cliente por Id
GET {{CustomersApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/1
Accept: application/json

### Crear un cliente
POST {{CustomersApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Linus",
  "lastName": "Torvalds",
  "email": "linus@example.com",
  "phone": "+54 11 5555-1234"
}

### Actualizar un cliente
PUT {{CustomersApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "King",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "phone": "+44 20 7946 0000"
}

### Eliminar un cliente
DELETE {{CustomersApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/3

### Error 409: email repetido
POST {{CustomersApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Otra",
  "lastName": "Ada",
  "email": "ada@example.com"
}

### Error 400: validación
POST {{CustomersApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "SinNombre",
  "email": "esto-no-es-un-email"
}
